      "reason": "Use Run-owner Task creation, ready-list readback, and checked launch of existing Tasks for dependencies. Observe the Task graph in an explicit read-only local view; keep portable plans and evidence replay independent of Orca. Match the installed host guide separately from the latest release."
    },
